    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d160-a1">

                <pb facs="0591" n="556" xml:id="pg556"/>


                <head><hi rendition="#bold">Memorandum From Secretary of State Vance to President
                        Carter</hi><anchor n="4" xml:id="d160-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>Washington,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1978-12-18">December 18, 1978</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Attached is a draft of white paper which was completed over the weekend. When you
                    have had a chance to go over it, I would appreciate the chance to talk to you
                    about it. I have reservations as to how much this really advances the debate.
                    Perhaps it might be better simply to release the documents, which speak for
                    themselves, and handle the questions and amplification either by on-the-record
                    or background sessions with the press.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#bold">Cyrus Vance</hi><anchor n="5" xml:id="d160-f2"
                        /></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
